      "community_name": "HubSpot Module & API Guidelines",
      "contributor": null,
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "norm_label": "hubspot rate limits (429)",
      "rationale": "At the data sizes involved (hundreds of records, 100 per page) a full pull is a handful of calls, so this rarely matters; a simple wait-and-retry on 429 is sufficient.",
